{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"b727394e1dca408e","x":-283,"y":393,"width":663,"height":187,"type":"text","text":"Ashk'lan religion is based upon the Ancient Greek one -- people do not supplicate to gods and instead treat their relationship as a transaction.\nThe King had since long looked to turn the Priests away from their gods entirely, and worship only himself. The Priests may have made an appearance of complying, deep inside, they foster the idea of taking revenge -- especially after the King took away some of their land to give to his nobles."}
	],
